LRC proof-route atlas (codex-2026-06-01-S505)
Convention: total_runners counts the stationary/reference runner when applicable.

Routes:
  BS07      2008 trust=5 direct=5 repo=4 runners= 7  Barajas-Serra seven runners
             fixed case: seven total runners; distance-graph/chromatic-number technology; important baseline
  Tao18     2018 trust=5 direct=4 repo=7 runners= -  Tao finite checking and Bohr-set gap
             general reduction plus asymptotic lower bound; finite checking at n^{O(n^2)} and log-improved loneliness gap
  PS60      2024 trust=4 direct=2 repo=6 runners= -  Perarnau-Serra survey
             panoramic map and open problems; best orientation source for terminology and open routes
  MSS25     2025 trust=5 direct=4 repo=8 runners= -  Malikiosis-Santos-Schymura finite checking
             general linearly-exponential finite reduction; zonotopal reduction to speeds up to binomial(n+1,2)^(n-1)
  ACS25     2025 trust=4 direct=1 repo=5 runners= 5  Alcantara-Criado-Santos shifted five runners
             shifted variant: five total runners; dyadic fundamental-domain covering-radius certificates
  R8        2025 trust=3 direct=5 repo=9 runners= 8  Rosenfeld eight runners
             fixed case: eight total runners; minimal counterexample product bound plus prime-divisibility forcing
  Bedert25  2025 trust=3 direct=3 repo=8 runners= -  Bedert Riesz-product wider gap
             general lower bound, not full LRC; nonnegative Riesz-product tests improve 1/(2n) by n^{-5/3+o(1)}
  T9T10     2025 trust=4 direct=5 repo=10 runners=10  Trakulthongchai nine and ten runners
             fixed cases: nine and ten total runners; fiber sieve makes Rosenfeld prime-divisibility checks tractable
  R9        2025 trust=3 direct=5 repo=8 runners= 9  Rosenfeld nine runners
             fixed case: nine total runners; independent refinement with small prime powers and SAT/set-cover view
  BCS26     2026 trust=3 direct=1 repo=5 runners= -  Blanco-Criado-Santos shifted counterexamples
             shifted LRC and lonely-vector property fail; shows shifted analogies cannot be imported into original LRC blindly
  ST13      2026 trust=3 direct=5 repo=10 runners=13  Sungkawichai-Trakulthongchai eleven to thirteen
             fixed cases: eleven to thirteen total runners; intermediate sieves plus polynomial method for the (1,...,k) residue
  Jensen26  2026 trust=2 direct=2 repo=7 runners= -  Jensen mixed thresholds
             mixed-threshold variant; exact MLPS_2 polygon and unequal-threshold Fourier formulas
  Repo26    2026 trust=2 direct=1 repo=10 runners= -  Repo endpoint-pressure program
             endpoint incidence, pressure DAGs, Tournament Analysis; turn external sieves into endpoint row-cover and pressure-peel certificates

